[00:03.723]I let my soul  fall into you
{"我放任灵魂坠入你怀中"}
[00:07.720]I never thought I'd fall right through
{"未曾想会彻底沦陷其中"}
[00:11.455]I fell for every word you said
{"轻信了你说的每句誓言"}
[00:18.769]You made me feel I needed you
{"你让我误以为非你不可"}
[00:22.531]And forced my heart to think it's true
{"强逼心脏相信这场谎言"}
[00:26.110]But I've found I'm powerless with you
{"却发现对你我无能为力"}
[00:32.640]Now I don't need your wings to fly
{"如今我不需借你翼翱翔"}
[00:39.667]Nooo I don't need your hand to hold in mine this time
{"这次我不需你手相牵"}
[00:47.713]You held me down but I broke free
{"你曾禁锢但我已挣脱"}
[00:51.422]I've found the love inside of me
{"我寻得了心底的爱火"}
[00:54.923]Now I don't need a hero to survive
{"如今我不需英雄来拯救"}
[01:00.513]Cause I already saved my life
{"因我早已自我拯救"}
